From: 1vivy <1vivy@tutanota.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 15:34:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sm8850-common-camera: add the SoC-common camera product/board
 fragments

First content drop of the two-tier camera topology split (task-8 design,
sections 4-5):

- sm8850-common-camera.mk: SoC-common camera product fragment, inherited
  by the per-device camera fragments. Documents the seven "common"-bucket
  surfaces (registration vintf/rc, camx impl libs, system_ext configs,
  init.camera_process.rc, the 526-file odm/etc/camera asset base,
  OplusCommercialEngineerCamera) whose payload bytes stay in
  vendor/oplus/camera per the deferred vendor-tier split (task-8
  section 3), and carries the family-order-only camera properties
  (task-8 section 4 "Order-only camera props" row) moved out of
  device/oneplus/sm8850-common vendor.prop.
- BoardConfigCommonCamera.mk + sepolicy/vendor: common camera sepolicy
  dir moved out of device/oneplus/sm8850-common (BoardConfigCommon.mk
  BOARD_SEPOLICY_DIRS line + sepolicy/vendor/file_contexts, introduced
  there by the "camera: public.libraries fixup" commit).
- README: replace the scaffold with the real repo contract.

